<del></del></span> Tier &amp; Set Bonuses for Restoration Druids in Mists of Pandaria Classic</span></h2>The set bonuses available in Phase 1 are fairly simple across the board and ours are actually quite good compared to some other classes that won't wear their tier set at all.<h3 class="heading-size-3 heading-bar" id="tier-14">
