<br/>Mana is limited in the first tier, so a 10% reduction to our most common cast is quite powerful. The four-piece bonus has great synergy with the Soul of the Forest talent since it better aligns the cooldowns of Swiftmend and Wild Growth. It's quite a bit weaker when you're running Incarnation.<h2 class="heading-size-2 heading-bar" id="trinkets">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c11" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/creatureportrait_twilightshammer_dragonegg_01.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> Best Restoration Druid Trinkets in Phase 1</span></h2>Our Phase 1 trinkets are all quite similar to one another. Most either offer passive intellect and a spirit proc, or passive spirit and an intellect proc. We'll be quite happy with either template since we'll be looking for more mana early in the expansion.<h5 class="heading-size-5" id="best-trinkets">Best Trinkets</h5>
<div class="wh-center" style="text-align: -webkit-center;">
<img alt="" class="border" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/uploads/screenshots/normal/1229171.png?maxWidth=800" style="border-width:3px" width="800"/></div>
<br/>
<br/>
<ins>Passive Trinkets</ins>
<ul class="exclude-units">
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=87163/spirits-of-the-sun">
