<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=79330/relic-of-chi-ji">
<img alt="Relic of Chi-Ji" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_inscription_trinket_crane.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Relic of Chi-Ji</span></a> (Inscription BoE): A powerful regen trinket that stands out by just having more average Spirit than its similar item-level competitors. Is beaten by heroic raid trinkets.</div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=75274/zen-alchemist-stone">
