<img alt="" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_nature_lightning.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Innervate</span></a>, but is still fine when used on cooldown. If you aren't an Alchemist and don't want to pay for <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=79330/relic-of-chi-ji">
